            <note corresp="#d907-f2" n="40" xml:id="d907-f2-content">
                <p>El Encanto claims arose in 1915 by reason of injuries to American soldiers and
                    property damage resulting from disturbances in the Coco Grove section of
                    Panama.</p>
            </note>
